<!--
    The Quick Settings tile icon.

    Deliberately a flat single-path silhouette on @android:color/white.
    SystemUI tints a tile icon itself, to whatever the theme and the tile's
    active or inactive state call for, so any colour committed here would
    either be thrown away or fight the shade. Shape is the only thing this
    file gets to decide.
-->
